### Get /
GET https://localhost:7214/
Accept: application/json

### Get all todos
GET https://localhost:7214/todos
Accept: application/json

### Get todo by ID
GET https://localhost:7214/todos/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a new todo
POST https://localhost:7214/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Title",
  "order": 2
}

### Patch a Todo
PATCH https://localhost:7214/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

[
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/order",
      "value": -1
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/title",
      "value": "New Title"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/completed",
      "value": true
    }
]

### Delete todo by ID
DELETE https://localhost:7214/todos/11

### Delete all Todos
DELETE https://localhost:7214/todos/
